  "draft_py": "# Joust Through: \"Joust Through deals 3 damage to target attacking or blocking creature. You gain 1 life.\"\n# Sentence 1 as Elspeth's Smite's (DEAL_DAMAGE 3; TYPE_EQ Creature and FOr(IS_ATTACKING,\n# IS_BLOCKING)). Sentence 2 is the compiler's B4-gain-life-n atom, kept, as the second step.\ndamage = A(Verb.DEAL_DAMAGE, {\n    'amount': QConst(value=3),\n    'target': Selector(\n        count=QConst(value=1),\n        mode=SelectorMode.TARGET,\n        filter=FAnd(children=(\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n            FOr(children=(\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_ATTACKING),\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_BLOCKING),\n            )),\n        )),\n        zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n    ),\n})\ngain = compiled[0].effect\nabilities = [SpellAbility(kind=SpellKind.INSTANT, effect=Seq(steps=(damage, gain)))]\n",
